From: Proton CRM <noreply@proton.local>
Subject: [PATCH] Filters: days_before no longer 500s on conversations/filter
 (Wave 2 Task 30, FIX-51)

POST /conversations/filter with created_at + filter_operator days_before
returned HTTP 500: FilterService#days_before_filter_query called
with_indifferent_access on an ActionController::Parameters (NoMethodError).
is_greater_than / is_less_than never hit that line. Convert Parameters with
to_unsafe_h first (plain hashes still work). Upstream bug at v4.15.1.

---
diff --git a/app/services/filter_service.rb b/app/services/filter_service.rb
index 25f118d..1b07515 100644
--- a/app/services/filter_service.rb
+++ b/app/services/filter_service.rb
@@ -99,7 +99,10 @@ class FilterService
 
   def days_before_filter_query(query_hash, current_index)
     date = Time.zone.today - query_hash['values'][0].to_i.days
-    updated_query_hash = query_hash.with_indifferent_access.merge(
+    # The controller hands us ActionController::Parameters, which has no
+    # with_indifferent_access (NoMethodError -> HTTP 500); plain hashes do.
+    base_hash = query_hash.respond_to?(:to_unsafe_h) ? query_hash.to_unsafe_h : query_hash
+    updated_query_hash = base_hash.with_indifferent_access.merge(
       values: [date.strftime],
       filter_operator: 'is_less_than'
     )
